id: merged-tuffle
name: Merged Tuffle
# The Parasitic Fusion's Method Trait: given as a Fusion is fused by that Method (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand.
fusionMethod: parasitic
description: >
  The combination of your powers allows you to withstand punishment neither of your constituent characters could have shrugged off alone.
text: >
  Merged Tuffle: The combination of your powers allows you to withstand punishment neither of your constituent characters could have shrugged off alone.
  (1)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Encounter]: Instead of gaining the Fused Character’s Apparel, you may choose to forgo it to increase your Combat Rolls and Damage Reduction by 2(bT).
  (2)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may use a Healing Surge.

---

[passive]
# (1) Its Combat Rolls and Damage Reduction: Merged Tuffle's mark's, for the Encounter (conditions/merged-tuffle-mark.dbu).
# (2) Its own Maneuver, on the Maneuvers tab (maneuvers/merged-tuffle-second-effect.dbu).

# (1) Entering the Encounter, asked: the Fused Characters' Apparel taken off for it (fusion-traits.mjs mergedTuffleForgo).
[triggered/start-of-encounter, effect 1]
mergedTuffleForgo();
